customExport.instructions:
Generator datapack for {{world}}

Target: {{edition}} {{version}}
World type: Single Biome
Biome: {{biome}}
Seed: {{seed}}

Install before creating the world:
1. In Create New World, open Data Packs and place this ZIP in the pack folder.
2. Enable the pack and return to the world settings.
3. Choose Single Biome as the world type and enter the exact seed above.
4. Create a new world. Do not add this pack to an existing save as a migration.

This archive configures the Overworld biome. It does not contain generated chunks or modify saves automatically.

